  "description": "Sleek simplicity describes the Kink Prophet frame. A no-frills, straight to the point, super-strong frame, that features all the modern specs and looks great while doing it. The modern but not extreme geometry makes this frame a stable and easy ride for just about anyone, and the custom designed gussets and stay bridges provide additional strength and stiffness. This frame comes standard with an integrated seat post clamp, integrated chain tensioners, and removable brake lugs for those looking to install brakes (mount kit sold separately).\n\nSeatstay Bridge\n\nThe Prophet frame features a sleek curved tubular seatstay bridge.\n\nDropout and Tensioners\n\nLaser cut dropouts with included integrated chain tensioners.\n\nGussets and Headtube\n\nFeaturing both toptube and downtube gussets and a modern 5\" headtube.",
